---
const words=['COLD','CORD','CARD','WARD','WARM'];
---
<figure class="word-ladder" data-word-ladder aria-labelledby="word-ladder-title">
  <div class="ladder-diagram" role="img" aria-label="COLD to CORD to CARD to WARD to WARM, changing one letter at each step.">
  <span class="ladder-heading">Word ladder <span>4 edits</span></span>
  <div class="ladder-steps" aria-hidden="true">
    {words.map((word,i)=><div class="ladder-step" data-ladder-step data-current={i===4 ? '' : undefined}>
      <span class="ladder-node"></span>
      <span class="ladder-word">{[...word].map((letter,j)=><span class:list={{'edited-letter':i>0&&letter!==words[i-1][j]}}>{letter}</span>)}</span>
      <span class="ladder-role">{i===0?'start':i===4?'goal':''}</span>
    </div>)}
  </div>
  </div>
  <figcaption class="ladder-caption">
    <span class="eyebrow">Illustrative example</span>
    <h3 id="word-ladder-title">One letter at a time</h3>
    <p>Each step changes one letter and keeps a valid word. This path reaches WARM in four edits.</p>
    <p>The study asks whether an allowed edit still leaves a route to the goal within the remaining edit budget.</p>
    <button type="button" class="ladder-replay" data-ladder-replay hidden>Replay edits <span aria-hidden="true">↻</span></button>
  </figcaption>
</figure>
<script>
  import {initWordLadder} from '../scripts/word-ladder';
  document.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>('[data-word-ladder]').forEach(initWordLadder);
</script>
<style>
  .word-ladder{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(180px,232px) minmax(0,1fr);align-items:center;gap:48px;padding:28px;margin-top:28px;border:1px solid var(--line);color:var(--ink);}
  .ladder-heading{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-size:11px;font-weight:550;color:var(--muted);}
  .ladder-heading>span{font-size:10px;font-weight:430;}
  .ladder-steps{position:relative;margin:19px 0 16px;}
  .ladder-steps:before{content:'';position:absolute;left:3px;top:15px;bottom:15px;width:1px;background:var(--line);}
  .ladder-step{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:19px;min-height:31px;position:relative;}
  .ladder-node{width:7px;height:7px;border:1px solid #969b90;background:white;border-radius:50%;flex-shrink:0;}
  .ladder-word{display:flex;gap:5px;font-size:18px;font-weight:450;letter-spacing:.02em;line-height:1.4;}
  .ladder-word>span{width:19px;text-align:center;position:relative;}
  .edited-letter{font-weight:650;}
  .edited-letter:after{content:'';position:absolute;bottom:-1px;left:3px;right:3px;height:1px;background:#9a9f94;}
  .ladder-role{margin-left:auto;font-size:10px;color:var(--muted);}
  [data-current] .ladder-node{background:var(--ink);border-color:var(--ink);}
  [data-current] .edited-letter{background:#edf0e9;}
  .ladder-caption .eyebrow{font-size:10px;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:10px;}
  .ladder-caption h3{font-size:20px;font-weight:580;letter-spacing:-.02em;line-height:1.35;margin-bottom:12px;}
  .ladder-caption p{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;margin-top:10px;}
  .ladder-replay{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;min-height:44px;font-size:12px;margin-top:14px;padding:8px 12px;border:1px solid var(--line);}
  .ladder-replay:hover{background:var(--wash);}
  @media(max-width:760px){.word-ladder{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:16px;padding:22px;}.ladder-diagram{width:232px;max-width:100%;justify-self:center;}}
  @media print{.word-ladder{break-inside:avoid;}.ladder-replay{display:none;}}
</style>
